{title: Amazing Grace}
{artist: John Newton}
{key: G}
{youtube: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Amazing+Grace+hymn}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Amazing [Em]grace how [C]sweet the [G]sound
That [G]saved a [D/F#]wretch like [G]me
I [G]once was [Em]lost but [C]now am [G]found
Was [G]blind but [D]now I [G]see
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
'Twas [G]grace that [Am]taught my [C]heart to [G]fear
And [G]grace my [D]fears re[G]lieved
How [G]precious [Em]did that [C]grace ap[G]pear
The [G]hour I [D]first be[G]lieved
{end_of_verse}

